<rml>
<!--
	The map over the whole screen drawn with RmlUi (ui.rmlui yes in eu07.ini): Tab shows it and hides it, so does Esc. The image
	of the map is drawn by the game under the element with the id view, which takes the mouse: dragged it moves the map, the
	wheel zooms it, the right button opens the panel of the signal, the switch, the level crossing, the obstacle or the vehicle
	under the cursor (or of the track there, to put an obstacle on), the middle one puts the free camera there. A copy of this
	file is built into the program; ui/map.rml in the game folder is used in its place.

	The values of the data model map_screen:
	shown            the map is shown
	available        the renderer draws the map (the opengl one does)
	mode             0: the map is moved by hand, 1: it follows the camera, 2: it follows a vehicle
	following        the vehicle followed is one chosen on the map, not the one driven
	layer_names, layer_objects, layer_grid   the names of the trains (of the train chosen always), the signals and the other
	                 objects, the grid are shown
	marks            the trains on the view: key (the name of the vehicle), name, speed (km/h), left and top (px within the
	                 view), heading (the rotation of the arrow), own (the train driven), selected
	trains           all the trains: key, name, speed, route, next (the next stop), late and delay (+N min), ai (driven by the
	                 autopilot), own, selected
	card, card_shown the train chosen, as in trains
	vehicles         the rolling stock to scale, while a vehicle is at least 6 px long: left, top (its middle), width (its length),
	                 height (its width), transform (centred and turned along the track), powered, own (of the consist driven);
	                 vehicles_drawn: there are some, the arrows of the trains aren't needed then
	scale_width, scale_text   the bar of the scale: its length in px, and what it is in m or km
	sig_shown        the nearest signal ahead of the train driven is known: sig_name, sig_distance, sig_heads (name, lamps: colour)
	grid             the lines of the grid: left, top, width (px) and rotate
	hover_shown      an object is under the cursor: hover_left, hover_top (px within the view), hover_kind, hover_name, and of a
	                 signal hover_heads: name and lamps (colour)
	obj_shown        the object clicked with the right button: obj_left, obj_top (px), obj_kind, obj_name; obj_choices (name, kind)
	                 when there's more than one there; of a signal obj_heads (name, lamps: colour); obj_actions_title and
	                 obj_actions (name): what can be done to it
	The events: view(mode) sets the mode, zoom(steps) zooms about the middle (above 0 closer), layer('names' | 'objects' |
	'grid') shows or hides a layer, select(key) chooses a train and follows it, unselect forgets it, close hides the map;
	pick(index) chooses an object of obj_choices, act(index) does an action of obj_actions, preview(index) shows the tracks a
	position of a switch sets (-1: none), lamp(head, lamp) sets a lamp of a signal to its next level, panel_close closes the
	panel of the object.

	The texts of the elements are looked up in the translations of the game (lang/*.po). An element repeated by data-for has no
	bindings of the items of its own, they're on the elements in it: RmlUi updates those after it drops the items an array lost,
	those of the repeated element itself before, which warns of an index out of bounds.
-->
<head>
	<title>Map</title>
	<style>
		body {
			display: block;
			position: absolute;
			left: 0;
			top: 0;
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			font-family: DejaVu Sans;
			font-size: 14dp;
			color: #e8ecef;
			pointer-events: none;
		}
		div {
			display: block;
		}
		#view {
			position: absolute;
			left: 0;
			top: 0;
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			pointer-events: auto;
		}

		/* the grid, the rolling stock, the trains and the card of the object, over the image of the map */
		.gridline {
			position: absolute;
			height: 1px;
			background-color: #ffffff14;
			transform-origin: 0 0;
		}
		.vehicle {
			position: absolute;
			border-radius: 1px;
			background-color: #e4e6e0;
			border: 1px #1a2617;
		}
		.vehicle.powered {
			background-color: #ffad42;
		}
		.vehicle.own {
			background-color: #8de05a;
		}
		.vehicle.own.powered {
			background-color: #41c400;
		}
		.mark {
			position: absolute;
			width: 480dp;
			height: 0;
		}
		.arrow {
			position: absolute;
			left: -9dp;
			top: -11dp;
			width: 18dp;
			color: #e4e6e0;
			font-size: 18dp;
			text-align: center;
			transform-origin: 50% 60%;
		}
		.mark.own .arrow {
			color: #41c400;
			font-size: 22dp;
		}
		.pill {
			position: absolute;
			left: 14dp;
			top: -11dp;
			padding: 2dp 8dp;
			border-radius: 10dp;
			background-color: #0e1217e0;
			border: 1dp #3a424a;
			font-size: 12dp;
			white-space: nowrap;
			pointer-events: auto;
		}
		.pill:hover {
			border-color: #c8d2da;
		}
		.mark.own .pill {
			border-color: #41c400;
		}
		.mark.selected .pill {
			border-color: #ffcc33;
		}
		.pill .speed {
			margin-left: 6dp;
			color: #8f9aa3;
		}
		#hover {
			position: absolute;
			min-width: 140dp;
			padding: 8dp 12dp;
			border-radius: 8dp;
			background-color: #0e1217f0;
			border: 1dp #3a424a;
			font-size: 12dp;
			pointer-events: none;
		}
		#hover .kind {
			color: #8f9aa3;
			font-size: 11dp;
		}
		#hover .name {
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		.head {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: center;
			margin-top: 4dp;
		}
		.head .lamps {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			margin-left: 8dp;
		}
		.lamp {
			width: 10dp;
			height: 10dp;
			margin-right: 3dp;
			border-radius: 5dp;
			border: 1dp #00000080;
		}

		/* the panel of the object clicked */
		#object {
			position: absolute;
			min-width: 200dp;
			max-width: 320dp;
			padding: 10dp 12dp;
			border-radius: 10dp;
			background-color: #161b21f2;
			border: 1dp #ffcc33;
			font-size: 13dp;
			pointer-events: auto;
		}
		#object .top {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: flex-start;
			margin-bottom: 6dp;
		}
		#object .kind {
			color: #8f9aa3;
			font-size: 11dp;
		}
		#object .section {
			margin-top: 8dp;
		}
		#object .name {
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		#object .x {
			margin-left: auto;
			padding: 0 6dp;
			border-radius: 6dp;
			color: #8f9aa3;
		}
		#object .x:hover {
			background-color: #232b33;
			color: #ffffff;
		}
		.actions {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			margin-top: 4dp;
		}
		.action {
			margin: 3dp 4dp 0 0;
			padding: 5dp 10dp;
			border-radius: 6dp;
			background-color: #232b33;
			color: #e8ecef;
		}
		.action:hover {
			background-color: #177f00;
		}
		.ckind {
			color: #8f9aa3;
			font-size: 11dp;
		}
		.lamp.big {
			width: 16dp;
			height: 16dp;
			margin-right: 5dp;
			border-radius: 8dp;
			border: 2dp #00000099;
		}
		.lamp.big:hover {
			border-color: #ffffff;
		}

		/* the panels */
		.panel {
			position: absolute;
			background-color: #161b21eb;
			border: 1dp #2c343c;
			border-radius: 12dp;
			pointer-events: auto;
		}
		#bar {
			top: 14dp;
			left: 16dp;
			right: 336dp;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: center;
			padding: 6dp;
		}
		.title {
			margin: 0 14dp 0 8dp;
			font-weight: bold;
			font-size: 16dp;
		}
		.group {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			margin-right: 10dp;
			padding: 2dp;
			border-radius: 8dp;
			background-color: #0e1217;
		}
		.button {
			padding: 5dp 11dp;
			border-radius: 6dp;
			color: #b9c3cb;
			text-align: center;
		}
		.button:hover {
			background-color: #232b33;
			color: #ffffff;
		}
		.button.active {
			background-color: #177f00;
			color: #ffffff;
		}
		.button.round {
			width: 16dp;
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		.close {
			margin-left: auto;
		}
		.close:hover {
			background-color: #c0261b;
		}

		/* the trains */
		#side {
			top: 14dp;
			right: 16dp;
			bottom: 16dp;
			width: 304dp;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			padding: 10dp;
		}
		.heading {
			margin: 2dp 4dp 8dp 4dp;
			color: #8f9aa3;
			font-size: 12dp;
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		#card {
			margin-bottom: 10dp;
			padding: 10dp 12dp;
			border-radius: 10dp;
			background-color: #0e1217;
			border: 1dp #ffcc33;
		}
		#card .top {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: center;
		}
		#card .name {
			font-size: 17dp;
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		#card .x {
			margin-left: auto;
			padding: 0 6dp;
			border-radius: 6dp;
			color: #8f9aa3;
		}
		#card .x:hover {
			background-color: #232b33;
			color: #ffffff;
		}
		#card .speedometer {
			margin-top: 6dp;
			font-size: 26dp;
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		#card .unit {
			margin-left: 4dp;
			color: #8f9aa3;
			font-size: 13dp;
			font-weight: normal;
		}
		.fact {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			margin-top: 4dp;
			font-size: 12dp;
		}
		.fact .label {
			width: 92dp;
			color: #8f9aa3;
		}
		.fact .value {
			flex: 1;
		}
		.late {
			color: #ff4a3d;
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		.ontime {
			color: #41c400;
		}
		#list {
			flex: 1;
			overflow-y: auto;
		}
		.train {
			padding: 7dp 8dp;
			margin-bottom: 4dp;
			border-radius: 8dp;
			border-left: 3dp #00000000;
		}
		.train:hover {
			background-color: #1f262d;
		}
		.train.own {
			border-left-color: #41c400;
		}
		.train.selected {
			background-color: #232b33;
			border-left-color: #ffcc33;
		}
		.train .line {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
		}
		.train .name {
			flex: 1;
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		.train .speed {
			color: #b9c3cb;
		}
		.train .route {
			margin-top: 2dp;
			color: #8f9aa3;
			font-size: 11dp;
		}
		.badge {
			margin-left: 6dp;
			padding: 0 5dp;
			border-radius: 4dp;
			background-color: #2c343c;
			color: #b9c3cb;
			font-size: 10dp;
			font-weight: normal;
		}
		.badge.you {
			background-color: #177f00;
			color: #ffffff;
		}
		scrollbarvertical {
			width: 6dp;
		}
		scrollbarvertical slidertrack {
			background-color: #00000000;
		}
		scrollbarvertical sliderbar {
			min-height: 30dp;
			border-radius: 3dp;
			background-color: #3a424a;
		}
		scrollbarvertical sliderarrowdec, scrollbarvertical sliderarrowinc {
			width: 0;
			height: 0;
		}

		/* the nearest signal and the scale */
		#scale {
			left: 16dp;
			bottom: 16dp;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: center;
			padding: 8dp 12dp;
		}
		.signal {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: center;
			margin-right: 16dp;
		}
		.mast {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			padding: 4dp;
			border-radius: 6dp;
			background-color: #0b0e11;
			border: 1dp #2c343c;
		}
		.heads {
			margin: 0 2dp;
		}
		.bulb {
			width: 12dp;
			height: 12dp;
			margin: 2dp 0;
			border-radius: 6dp;
			border: 1dp #00000099;
		}
		.about {
			margin-left: 10dp;
		}
		.about .kind {
			color: #8f9aa3;
			font-size: 11dp;
		}
		.about .name {
			font-weight: bold;
		}
		.about .distance {
			color: #ffcc33;
			font-size: 12dp;
		}
		.bar {
			height: 4dp;
			border: 1dp #e8ecef;
			border-top-width: 0;
		}
		.scaletext {
			margin-left: 8dp;
			font-size: 12dp;
		}
		#help {
			left: 16dp;
			top: 66dp;
			padding: 5dp 12dp;
			border-radius: 8dp;
			font-size: 11dp;
			color: #8f9aa3;
		}
		.unavailable {
			position: absolute;
			left: 0;
			top: 0;
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			background-color: #0e1217ee;
			pointer-events: auto;
		}
		.unavailable .message {
			margin-top: 40%;
			text-align: center;
			color: #8f9aa3;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body data-model="map_screen">
	<div data-if="shown">
		<div id="view">
			<div data-if="layer_grid">
				<div data-for="line : grid">
					<div class="gridline" data-style-left="line.left" data-style-top="line.top" data-style-width="line.width" data-style-transform="line.rotate"></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div data-for="vehicle : vehicles">
				<div class="vehicle" data-style-left="vehicle.left" data-style-top="vehicle.top" data-style-width="vehicle.width" data-style-height="vehicle.height" data-style-transform="vehicle.transform" data-class-powered="vehicle.powered" data-class-own="vehicle.own"></div>
			</div>
			<div data-for="mark : marks">
				<div class="mark" data-style-left="mark.left" data-style-top="mark.top" data-class-own="mark.own" data-class-selected="mark.selected">
					<div class="arrow" data-if="!vehicles_drawn" data-style-transform="mark.heading">▲</div>
					<div class="pill" data-if="layer_names || mark.selected" data-event-click="select(mark.key)">{{mark.name}}<span class="speed">{{mark.speed}} km/h</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div id="hover" data-if="hover_shown && !obj_shown" data-style-left="hover_left" data-style-top="hover_top">
				<div class="kind">{{hover_kind}}</div>
				<div class="name">{{hover_name}}</div>
				<div data-for="head : hover_heads">
					<div class="head">
						<span>{{head.name}}</span>
						<div class="lamps">
							<div data-for="lamp : head.lamps">
								<div class="lamp" data-style-background-color="lamp.colour"></div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="object" data-if="obj_shown" data-style-left="obj_left" data-style-top="obj_top">
			<div class="top">
				<div>
					<div class="kind">{{obj_kind}}</div>
					<div class="name">{{obj_name}}</div>
				</div>
				<span class="x" data-event-click="panel_close">×</span>
			</div>
			<div data-for="choice, c : obj_choices">
				<div class="action" data-event-click="pick(c)"><span class="ckind">{{choice.kind}}</span> {{choice.name}}</div>
			</div>
			<div data-for="head, h : obj_heads">
				<div class="head">
					<span>{{head.name}}</span>
					<div class="lamps">
						<div data-for="lamp, l : head.lamps">
							<div class="lamp big" data-style-background-color="lamp.colour" data-event-click="lamp(h, l)"></div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="kind section" data-if="obj_actions_title != ''">{{obj_actions_title}}</div>
			<div class="actions">
				<div data-for="action, a : obj_actions">
					<div class="action" data-event-click="act(a)" data-event-mouseover="preview(a)" data-event-mouseout="preview(-1)">{{action.name}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="unavailable" data-if="!available">
			<div class="message">The map is drawn by the OpenGL renderer only</div>
		</div>

		<div id="bar" class="panel">
			<span class="title">Map</span>
			<div class="group">
				<div class="button round" data-event-click="zoom(-1)">−</div>
				<div class="button round" data-event-click="zoom(1)">+</div>
			</div>
			<div class="group">
				<div class="button" data-class-active="mode == 0" data-event-click="view(0)">Pan</div>
				<div class="button" data-class-active="mode == 1" data-event-click="view(1)">Follow camera</div>
				<div class="button" data-class-active="mode == 2 && !following" data-event-click="view(2)">Follow vehicle</div>
			</div>
			<div class="group">
				<div class="button" data-class-active="layer_names" data-event-click="layer('names')">Names</div>
				<div class="button" data-class-active="layer_objects" data-event-click="layer('objects')">Signals</div>
				<div class="button" data-class-active="layer_grid" data-event-click="layer('grid')">Grid</div>
			</div>
			<div class="button round close" data-event-click="close">×</div>
		</div>

		<div id="side" class="panel" data-if="available">
			<div id="card" data-if="card_shown">
				<div class="top">
					<span class="name">{{card.name}}</span>
					<span class="badge you" data-if="card.own">You</span>
					<span class="badge" data-if="card.ai">AI</span>
					<span class="x" data-event-click="unselect">×</span>
				</div>
				<div class="speedometer">{{card.speed}}<span class="unit">km/h</span></div>
				<div class="fact" data-if="card.route != ''">
					<span class="label">Route</span>
					<span class="value">{{card.route}}</span>
				</div>
				<div class="fact" data-if="card.next != ''">
					<span class="label">Next stop</span>
					<span class="value">{{card.next}}</span>
				</div>
				<div class="fact">
					<span class="label">Delay</span>
					<span class="value late" data-if="card.late">{{card.delay}}</span>
					<span class="value ontime" data-if="!card.late">On time</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="heading">Trains</div>
			<div id="list">
				<div data-for="train : trains">
					<div class="train" data-class-own="train.own" data-class-selected="train.selected" data-event-click="select(train.key)">
						<div class="line">
							<span class="name">{{train.name}}</span>
							<span class="speed">{{train.speed}} km/h</span>
						</div>
						<div class="route" data-if="train.route != ''">{{train.route}}</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="scale" class="panel" data-if="available">
			<div class="signal" data-if="sig_shown">
				<div class="mast">
					<div data-for="head : sig_heads">
						<div class="heads">
							<div data-for="lamp : head.lamps">
								<div class="bulb" data-style-background-color="lamp.colour"></div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="about">
					<div class="kind">Signal</div>
					<div class="name">{{sig_name}}</div>
					<div class="distance">{{sig_distance}}</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="bar" data-style-width="scale_width"></div>
			<span class="scaletext">{{scale_text}}</span>
		</div>
		</div>
		<div id="help" class="panel" data-if="available">Drag: move · Wheel: zoom · Right button: signals, switches, obstacles · Click a train: follow it</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
